# TAA STARTERKIT ARCHITECTURE RULES
- Strict SoC: Ultra-Thin Controller (only Yajra DT dataDt & downloads), Static Repository for all DB operations, Livewire for UI/forms ($form = []).
- Views: Global templates in `resources/views/templates/`, module views in `resources/views/mods/`.
- Routing & ATC: Index blade must wrap table container with wire:ignore. ATC script must handle DataTable destroy on re-init and listen to livewire:navigated.
- Modal & DT Reload: Use hookModalDelete dispatching to universal modal; trigger reloadDT for reactive table refresh without page reload.
- Always check `agents/agents.md` for specific architectural guidelines.
